      "source": "# Your PowerShell vs. Python toolbelt\r\n## PowerShell\tPython equivalent\r\n-   Get-Help Get-Process -Examples\tSearch the web/docs for Python examples\r\n-   Get-Member\tdir() and type()\r\n-   Get-Command\tdir(module) (roughly)\r\n-   Tab completion\tVS Code IntelliSense\r\n-   PowerShell Gallery examples\tPyPI project documentation and GitHub examples"
